      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bagoteebigwa barwane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko riria omorwoti Ahaswero akaa Esiteri eting’ana enyomba ya Hamani, omobisa oria bw’Abayahudi. Moredekai akanyora ribaga gosoa ase omorwoti, ekiagera Esiteri konya oteebirie omorwoti igoro y’obwamate bwaye na moredekai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono omorwoti akarusia ebonyi eria arusetie ase Hamani, akayea Moredekai, na Esiteri akabeeka Moredekai atenenere enyomba eria yarenge eya Hamani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Esiteri agakwana naende nomorwoti, agatung’ama inse ase amagoro aye, akamosorora mono ase ogoitekia amariga ng’a asarie omooroberio bw’ogosiria Abayahudi, oria Hamani Omoagagi aruete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akaimokia enyimbo eria y’etaabu, akayiorotera",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiteri. Esiteri akaimoka, agatenena ase obosio bw’omorwoti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabora, “Aye omorwoti, onye kwarorire ng’a mbuya, na onye inche nanyorire ogwancherwa asore, ne ring’ana eri korirarorekane asore ng’a nerironge, aye omorwoti, naende inche ninkogokie, koranche karwe ogochika gotanga amang’ana aria Hamani, mosinto o Hamedata Omoagagi, konya achiikire ng’a Abayahudi bonsi bare ase chingongo chionsi chi’obogambi bwao basirigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki ndakore ndemererie ndore amabe ayio akobacheera abaminto? Gose naki ndakore ndemererie ndore abanto b’egesaku kiane bagosirigwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Ahaswero agateebia Esiteri eting’ana na Moredekai Omoyahudi, “Rora, naeire Esiteri enyomba ya Hamani, na Hamani otongirwe igoro ase orobambo roria, ekiagera arigetie goita Abayahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki inwe riika riruube ase Abayahudi, moribeeke erieta riane, inche omorwoti, morike buna morarore, moribeeke ekemanyererio ki’ebonyi yane, ekiagera riruube rinde rionsi ririikire na kobeekwa erieta ri’omorwoti amo nekemanyererio ki’ebonyi yaye, onde tari orarionchore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abariki b’omorwoti bakarangerigwa agwo ase omotienyi o gatato, noro omotienyi o Siwani, rituko ri’emerongo ebere na gatato, na buna Moredekai achigete, amarube akarikwa gochia ase Abayahudi, na gochia ase abagaambi abanene b’oborwoti na abagabana, na abanene bonsi be chingongo chionsi korwa India goika Ethiopia, chingongo rigana erimo, na emerongo ebere, na isano na ibere (127). Amarube ayio akarikwa ase kera orogongo ase okorikwa kw’engencho y’amariko abo, na ase kera egesaku ase omonwa obo na ase Abayahudi ase enchera yabo y’okorika ase omonwa obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio nigo arigetwe na kobeekwa erieta ri’omorwoti Ahaswero, na akabeekwa ekemanyererio ki’ebonyi yaye. Erio amarube ayio akairwa nabariini be chibarasi chi’omorwoti echio chiare kominyoka bwango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amarube ayio nigo arenge goteeba ng’a omorwoti orure ribaga ase Abayahudi ba kera omochie bache amo, erinde beegerere abanyene. Baegwe ribaga boigo goita abarwani bande bonsi ba kera egesaku baare gocha kobarwania, baite nabana babo na abakungu babo; boigo basakore chinibo chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio akoreke ase rituko erimo ase chingongo chionsi chi’omorwoti Ahaswero, ne rituko erio nigo rirabe eria ikomi na gatato ri’omotienyi o ikomi na kabere okorokwa Adari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo ariikire ng’a ase kera orogongo ogochika okwo kw’omorwoti korarigwe maiso marore ase abanto bonsi ng’a, Abayahudi bebeeke ang’e ase rituko erio erio korusia egesiomba ase ababisa babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ogochika okwo kw’omorwoti abatomwa bakariina chibarasi chi’omorwoti chiare kominyoka bwango. Ogochika koria gokararigwa boigo agwo Susa, omochie oria omonene bw’eburi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moredekai akarua ase omorwoti, obegete chianga chi’oborwoti chire nekieni kere buru na ekerabu, obegete egutwa enene y’etaabu na egetambaa gi’okwambara ki’egatani engiya kere monyinga, na abanto b’omochie o Susa bagaaka eriogi, bagochenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayahudi bakaba noborabu na omogooko, amo nomochengo na ogosikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase kera orogongo na omochie, aande onsi ogochika kw’omorwoti kwaraaretigwe, Abayahudi bakaba nomogooko na omochengo, bagakora omoyega na bakaba ne Rituko Rinene. Abanto abange b’ebisaku binde bagekora koba Abayahudi ase okwoboa Abayahudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
